{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "58f1e16bbf4c69bc7360a1c10c705e1227dd9f773e22cd7ab2f15cc31b5bba05", "ja": "（まさしく盛夏！　夏っぽいユニットを仕掛けたい\nけど……いいアイディアは転がってないものか……）", "zh": "（正是盛夏！想打造一个充满夏日气息的组合，不过……有没有什么好点子呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "f050e49ed355b24ea9162b554813cb038b2ec620b354bd4a677c6d31f277af32", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです。お待ちしてましたよ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了。我们等您很久了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a4ce77aa2d10f4806051a996d2fbb7cb2c1c8efcf00350a913356855857fe5b3", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\n待っていた、というのは……？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n您说在等我，是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "fec41cdc309495670a90bfefbe8b4b86a2066b52f02d383fe0d0f5ecad9bbf26", "ja": "私、この間の休みに種子島に帰省したので、\nお土産をお渡ししたくって。こちらです！", "zh": "我前阵子休假回了趟种子岛，\n想给您带点土特产。就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b7483e525777c9962e4219fbdfbc2bac542f797d3eb36a54699cbc90e795f4b0", "ja": "そうですか、ありがとうございます！\nこれは……ずいぶん立派な、ほら貝ですね。", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢你！\n这可是……非常气派的海螺呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "9902f034cea41e955376d43710f3eb6de13fc67ff9414c769b1a71b8ef368232", "ja": "はい！　近所の海に潜った時に見つけたんです！\nすごく大きかったから、お姉ちゃんと驚いちゃって。", "zh": "是的！我在附近的海里潜水时发现的！\n因为特别大，我和姐姐都吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "495d048cb00dfc60b2bb3848e2886753d49e50dc477af2251c9e624f0872aff8", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nぜひ、持って帰ってくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n请务必带回去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3c1781269bff6971d162723cd40df73fdc8a3d73fe88cc3b97725e6774933402", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。すごく、海を感じる\nお土産ですね！　夏らしくて豪快というか……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您。这个伴手礼很有大海的感觉！很有夏天的气息，或者说……真是够豪爽的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "87e0043dbcf5a8ba783728948273fed30dfde7804a3cdaffd0362445710ab52d", "ja": "ほら貝ユニット……。\n悪くないけど、今ではない気がする……。", "zh": "海螺乐器组合……。\n感觉不坏，但好像不是现在该做的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "f558e96db0a7bf66eb49946824af0c97df01c424e7176a946b32243b5775d3f2", "ja": "ほら貝ユニット？", "zh": "海螺组合？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e599cbc5488368c8c48b1b28b09619c19d3ecc1fadfdac621a48997673c192a2", "ja": "あ、いや、仕事のアイディアを探してまして、\nなにかできないかななんて……。", "zh": "啊，不是，我是在找工作的点子，想着有没有什么能做的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "186d4356a8a1da9bdecd7dd63c6b4213d972e50a32f981ea2b221ee17dd22199", "ja": "そうだったんですか。\nでも、根を詰め過ぎるのは体に毒ですよ？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n不过，太过拼命对身体可不好哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "47db448a7b22f206cb5528e4c0dc390a7fe4d17363b4710b4b0a08f4321dedfe", "ja": "冷蔵庫にゼリーのお土産もありますから、\n食べてリフレッシュしてくださいね♪", "zh": "冰箱里还有果冻伴手礼，吃点放松一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "18a63c2f02461f879ecbe77033603c3b5dfbcf75dde42f58eed00f0b47c9133f", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nお土産両方とも、ありがたくいただきます！", "zh": "谢谢！\n两份特产我都心怀感激地收下了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "d38d6a5f8f66b468082412bf4f6df69510f0ff696c4f9e4a86c4b2fdaf5eaf7d", "ja": "いえいえ。そういえば、社長さんも言ってましたよ。\n{$P$}さんにお土産があるって。", "zh": "不客气。说起来，社长也说过呢。\n说是有礼物要给{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a47804f0ab999d543b7e321fff0814722e43e8dc97e89551f2f803b64564eceb", "ja": "社長がですか？　じゃあ顔を出さないと……。\n青羽さん、ちょっと行ってきますね。", "zh": "社长？那我得去露个面……。美咲，我去一下哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "508dec08935552bea69ce252d291a2cf427d7104bc341b618405826d7a087422", "ja": "はーい！　いってらっしゃ～い♪　ほら貝、\nかわいくデコっておいた方がよかったかな……？", "zh": "好——！路上小心哦～♪ 不过，海螺是不是应该装饰得更可爱一点呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1017_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "671d66ee0e6c22ae68f0ae57443836e2962d6192f87fbeaa72797c5e9189d588", "ja": "……というわけで、この前の休暇は海辺で\n過ごしていてね。バカンス気分で、悪くなかったよ。", "zh": "……所以说，上次休假我是在海边\n度过的。颇有度假的感觉，挺不错的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "8eb6060208200a41a796c5bb69e0d728a4488776da8df69e5bd8fbdb62972339", "ja": "いいですね～。私はエアコンの効いた部屋から\n出るのが億劫で、出不精な夏でしたね……。", "zh": "真不错呢～我因为懒得走出开着空调的房间，度过了一个足不出户的夏天呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "a81de3359518ce68894f4bf31d469044515c1cc6dfbadd261505dcff8237c5bb", "ja": "ひとりだと面倒でも、誰かと一緒だと楽しくなったり\nするものだよ。音無君も、誰か海に誘ってみるといい。", "zh": "即使一个人会觉得麻烦，但和谁一起的话，也会变得有趣哦。音无君也可以试着邀请谁一起去海边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "137c9a94fbf6dbee4f661a90d620f743a10571fa096d5662feaca6c179c36c3a", "ja": "誘う誰かというのが問題でして……。\nわ、私が声をかけられるのなんて……。", "zh": "问题就在要邀请谁……。\n像我这样，能搭话的对象……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b1b926964e2ab2b50a9b8269eff07c4a9cd59f7923d192982a2581ec5408fd84", "ja": "お疲れさまです、社長、音無さん。青羽さんから、\nお土産があるとうかがって来たのですが……。", "zh": "辛苦了，社长、音无小姐。听青羽小姐说有伴手礼，所以我就过来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "e238d8a7b50ef17670940d01fedf2695c4d1678c0b0f31d47021c4791603a48c", "ja": "きゃっ！？　{$P$}さん、\nお、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "呀！？　{$P$}先生，您、您好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3048c27b46bc4a0fbcea207bdbf1ecf867875acac099bbd2c29a867404aa8bf2", "ja": "？　音無さん、なんだか顔が赤いですけど……\n大丈夫ですか？　もしかして夏風邪だったり？", "zh": "？音无小姐，您的脸好像有点红……没事吧？难道是得了夏季感冒？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "c4d9aca962318f4c34d2d61f361c231867ef639fdf9c59c367bc864999f16c2b", "ja": "い、いえいえ！　大丈夫です！\nエアコンがちょっと強かったのかしら……あはは。", "zh": "没、没有的事！我没事！\n可能是空调开得有点猛了吧……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "58e91ba1965855c59ce660e11e97b844979e8d7905a3e9d12a7db8c3e4f331f8", "ja": "君、よく来てくれたね！\n実は早急に君に渡したいものがあったんだ。", "zh": "你来得正好！\n其实我有件东西想尽快交给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "b05e83c241c3a383292413dbb75b41d7cc11e8e68b2e24ec570cd3ea5c7e9b7f", "ja": "そろそろ新ユニットについての\nアイディアを探しているのではないかと思ってね。", "zh": "我想着，你差不多也该在找关于新组合的点子了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a07986a93d45698c418fff7d268b99926a43912f4d9c92de568f898035367049", "ja": "な、何故それを……！", "zh": "为、为什么你会知道……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "ddf005349bae90ffb00af0f6ed8cf576436735bdb0c1100f3bad018e802b3efe", "ja": "これでも社長だからね、見くびってもらっては困るよ。\n悩める君へ、私からのプレゼントだ。", "zh": "我好歹也是社长，可不能小看我啊。\n送给烦恼中的你，这是我的礼物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "82b562869d6bec5bcdfc80730a5c02502f99b1c323b199bf6d88727fca3ea1f1", "ja": "こ、これは……！\n……ウクレレですね！", "zh": "这、这是……！\n……是尤克里里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "d8bdcf0d5b962efb92b28011a069876d49307c860437afb163fd6ac43584d8b1", "ja": "（……うーん、ウクレレユニットも悪くないけど……\nもっとこう、なんというか……！）", "zh": "（……嗯——乌克丽丽组合也不错，可是……怎么说呢，还应该更……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "db26d559fc44fc86f7cf892fd4ad5f6ddfc30da56ef688e5e1f35f10f6f3960b", "ja": "おや？\nウクレレでは物足りなかったかな？", "zh": "哦？用尤克里里还觉得不够吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "0f750383d95192ba2d69bd5a6edb87677a8b3056596f54383c80eb2bbc2bbf14", "ja": "えっ、いえ！　ありがとうございます！\nいやぁ、よく見ると素晴らしい色ツヤで……。", "zh": "诶，不是的！谢谢您！\n哎呀，仔细一看，颜色和光泽真是漂亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1034_president", "source_sha256": "d1563382fbf2182a2805f8889a4db7223712f5f0b6b0b282768e09b9b9e26531", "ja": "はっはっは。いやいや、なに、\nウクレレは前座でね。本命はこちらだよ！", "zh": "哈哈哈。不是不是，怎么说呢，\n尤克里里只是开场，本命是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1036_p", "source_sha256": "d4237778558be9efdfd0bdf7a5e8b3d7891a26c2f5cafc5ae503db5309bac4ca", "ja": "おお！\nこ、これは……！", "zh": "哦哦！\n这、这是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1037_101kot", "source_sha256": "684335c9f192118e262e9fae7fd2e3fe3e43215ed055b6221fae02a66daabdaa", "ja": "わあ……♪　幻想的で、なんだか癒やされます♪\nとっても素敵なお土産じゃないですか！", "zh": "哇……♪ 真梦幻，让人不知不觉就被治愈了♪\n这不是一份非常棒的伴手礼吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1038_p", "source_sha256": "4ccdc8192940e93195e387f6cffdfb054287d2667b4ef20e48653ec97283eaff", "ja": "ええ。どこまでも透明で、明るくてきれいで、\n健やかで楽しげで……そんな海が浮かびますね！", "zh": "是啊。那片海清澈见底、明亮美丽，充满生机、欢快热闹……仿佛浮现在眼前呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_1039", "source_sha256": "419d173a0640985a7502b860a4da2ed38ef11e7678601f6a817d22264094316d", "ja": "これだ！", "zh": "就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "12b2c5fbd68e07c02ab3c8af56afcfcfb4190efae2943877cfb9c01d1415326c", "ja": "これです！　穏やかで明るい海のイメージ……\nこれをコンセプトにしたユニットを作りましょう！", "zh": "就是这个！以宁静明亮的大海为意象……\n就以此为概念，组建一个组合吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "ef680146a44c6ec4c3be7686562f438750fb807d7e37d01ba8ef6d44bb27d9c2", "ja": "この曲のポテンシャルを感じ取ってくれたみたいだね。\nさすがは我が765プロのプロデューサーだ！", "zh": "看来你感受到了这首歌的潜力呢。\n不愧是我们765事务所的制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_2002_p", "source_sha256": "09eee5cd157bdfb7e109b45e129458f9e3e41fdd0b5a4bfaf6b12c6ded767fad", "ja": "こうしている場合じゃない……頭に浮かんだ\nメンバーがいるので、まずは声をかけてみます！", "zh": "不能再这样下去了……我想到了一位成员，先去跟她打个招呼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "c690d3569a94e12ff11ec70fa8f907502368174e4ffd19df4ff307f388fa52d1", "ja": "うむ、よろしく頼むよ！\nこの夏、まだまだ忙しくなりそうだね！", "zh": "嗯，之后就拜托你了！\n这个夏天看来还会越来越忙呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0148_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "7bccc43438c885217f8206a2d7959a07b9755e533c82047f801a3e1d8cfcc367", "ja": "やっぱり我々はお仕事が本分ですからね！\n……ちょっぴり残念なような気もしますけど……うう。", "zh": "毕竟我们的大本营还是工作嘛！\n……虽然总觉得也有点可惜就是了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
